Nara SAR is Nara's Burmese/English fine-tune of Meta omniASR-CTC-300M.
Upstream model: https://huggingface.co/facebook/omniASR-CTC-300M
Copyright 2025 Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
The model is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This release includes Nara's fine-tuned acoustic weights, matching tokenizer,
bilingual character language model, final CTC beam decoder and Burmese structural
syllable rules. Original checkpoint tensors were repackaged losslessly into
SafeTensors. The ONNX exports adapt the inference graph; the INT8 variant
quantizes constant matrix multiplications and retains FP32 convolutions.

ONNX Runtime is provided by Microsoft under the MIT license and is installed
separately. NumPy and SoundFile retain their own licenses.
